      "Id": "2d77f5af-2a05-521e-9736-1d45c103ac35",
      "ChildId": "d7427bf8-6881-54bd-82e2-a59450cfd69b",
      "InputId": "e0616bd7-2a4a-5953-95a5-a11929871bd9",
      "Description": "Intersection keeps only what is inside both: the rounded box with its corners cut off by the sphere.",
