      "Description": "Union merges the three bars into one cutting tool.",
      "Style": "InfoFor"
    },
    {
      "Id": "d3944104-f6a3-52a9-81dc-b2534c72145c",
      "ChildId": "afac1586-426c-5395-9c8c-87a99625e10b",
      "InputId": "e0616bd7-2a4a-5953-95a5-a11929871bd9",
      "Description": "Difference carves VolumeB out of VolumeA: the body with three square and round holes.",
      "Style": "InfoFor"
    },
    {
      "Id": "f242f423-f88c-5ea6-999b-2ac3a0010723",
      "ChildId": "2e394fad-29aa-592c-83d8-6ce2d278b4fc",
      "Description": "Only the end of the chain is meshed; every step before it stays a level set.",
